  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Technical Assistance for Health investment supports the secondment by Global Health Division (GHD) of technical expertise in health in order to inform the evidence base for health policy and programming.  Funding has supported: the World Health Organisation performance assessment; regional health security governance framework design; contraceptive social marketing investment in the Pacific; integrating donor-financed health programs in Indonesia and other Southeast Asian countries; and facilitation of planning workshop on private sector engagement in health in South East Asia. It has also supported the funding of a Nutrition Adviser in 2017-18, and a study tour in association with  the 2023 AIDs conference.</narrative>
  </description>
